<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 499 MLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 499 MLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 499 million zlotys at the finance ministry's primary T-bill tender against a 600 million zloty offer, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>The full results of the tender are due later on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
